<title>LATVIA: UNIBANKA AUCTION PRICE SET AT 3.22 LATS.</title>
<headline>UNIBANKA AUCTION PRICE SET AT 3.22 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction price of Latvian Unibanka's one million shares, part of the 33 percent state stake, was set at 3.22 lats per share, the bourse said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;All the shares on offer have been sold and the price was set at 3.22 lats,&quot; a bourse spokesperson told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;The total demand, all prices taken together, came to 3.3 million lats and turnover was 3.22 million lats,&quot; she added.</p>
<p>The auction results still have to be confirmed by the Latvian Privatisation Agency (LPA).</p>
<p>-- Martinsh Gravitis, Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
